@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
title SEQUENCE - REFRESH / LOGOUT [ADVANCED]

actor User
participant "Next.js" as FE
participant "Auth API" as API
participant "Security Service" as Security
database "Redis session store" as Redis

note over User,Redis
Advanced feature. Không nằm trong OpenAPI MVP.
MVP logout chỉ xóa Access Token phía client.
end note

== Refresh ==
User -> FE : access token hết hạn
FE -> API : POST /auth/refresh + HttpOnly Cookie
API -> Security : verify/rotate refresh session
Security -> Redis : validate + rotate/revoke old session
Redis --> Security : OK
Security --> API : new access + refresh
API --> FE : 200 access token + Set-Cookie HttpOnly

== Logout ==
FE -> API : POST /auth/logout
API -> Security : revoke current refresh session
Security -> Redis : revoke
API --> FE : 204 + clear cookie
@enduml
